{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cMy parrots are odd ones\u201d</strong> is a fun cryptography game with simple rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features eccentric parrots that don't just repeat what you say!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover their unique <strong>\u201cobsessive algorithms\u201d</strong> through word exchanges and befriend these colorful parrots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, out of the blue, an invitation to an event arrived from an organization with the somewhat unusual name of the Parrot Association.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124840/extras/f8e5eea4e7f38d1dfb1ed7ea0a46ace3.avif?t=1761752228\" width=257 height=363 /></span>\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124840/extras/6356e73ab015f1b3024e78a0d8207410.avif?t=1761752228\" width=259 height=363 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though it's unclear, it seems quite a few eccentric parrots are waiting to talk with challengers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite harboring doubts about what this is all about, you find yourself drawn to the oddball parrots and their peculiar obsessions, and head toward the event venue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GamePlay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you speak to the parrots, they respond by transforming your words according to specific rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each parrot has a distinct personality, and their word transformation rules come with unique quirks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through conversation, uncover their \u201cobsessive algorithms\u201d and get them to say the target word!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4124840?t=1761752228","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124840/88a628629ea2610f06e25b8f82a415588aeb32f4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761752228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124840/c8ef63352fee03888ccb1d50d9d81449a4f7f1d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761752228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124840/c8ef63352fee03888ccb1d50d9d81449a4f7f1d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761752228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cMy parrots are odd ones\u201d</strong> is a fun cryptography game with simple rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features eccentric parrots that don't just repeat what you say!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover their unique <strong>\u201cobsessive algorithms\u201d</strong> through word exchanges and befriend these colorful parrots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, out of the blue, an invitation to an event arrived from an organization with the somewhat unusual name of the Parrot Association.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124840/extras/f8e5eea4e7f38d1dfb1ed7ea0a46ace3.avif?t=1761752228\" width=257 height=363 /></span>\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124840/extras/6356e73ab015f1b3024e78a0d8207410.avif?t=1761752228\" width=259 height=363 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though it's unclear, it seems quite a few eccentric parrots are waiting to talk with challengers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite harboring doubts about what this is all about, you find yourself drawn to the oddball parrots and their peculiar obsessions, and head toward the event venue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GamePlay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you speak to the parrots, they respond by transforming your words according to specific rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each parrot has a distinct personality, and their word transformation rules come with unique quirks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through conversation, uncover their \u201cobsessive algorithms\u201d and get them to say the target word!</p>","developers":["HotaxeGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124840/685ad19e42de29aaca920969ebd222096dff128c/header.jpg?t=1761752228","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4124840/535328130/f6c09b5d5d6068e7140ff9692c2386f0df20d7d6/1761060240/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761752227","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4124840/535328130/f6c09b5d5d6068e7140ff9692c2386f0df20d7d6/1761060240/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761752227","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4124840/535328130/f6c09b5d5d6068e7140ff9692c2386f0df20d7d6/1761060240/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761752227","id":257220551,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220551/movie480.mp4?t=1761752227","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220551/movie_max.mp4?t=1761752227"},"name":"\u300c\u3046\u3061\u306e\u30aa\u30a6\u30e0\u306f\u5909\u308f\u308a\u8005\u300dPV","thumbnail":"https://